        "\n",
        "Use an AI assistant as a mathematical tutor, not as a black box.  Good prompts force the assistant to state the conditioning, the probability distribution, and the loss function.\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.callout-tip}\n",
        "## Prompt 1: identify the distribution\n",
        "\n",
        "Ask:\n",
        "\n",
        "> In the sentence `language models predict tokens`, list the autoregressive training pairs.  For each pair, identify the prefix, the target token, and the conditional probability that appears in the likelihood.\n",
        "\n",
        "Then check whether the answer correctly distinguishes $p(w_t\\mid w_{<t})$ from $p(w_{<t}\\mid w_t)$.\n",
